\ls12\ilvl0
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
comptime if conforms_to(ErrType, Writable)
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  \'97 Check if the error implements 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 Writable
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 .\
\ls12\ilvl0
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
trait_downcast[Writable](err)
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  \'97 Access the error through its 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 Writable
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  interface.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
